y <- new("Normal", mean = 1, sd = 4)
u <- new("Uniform", min = 0, max = 6)
x + y
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
Normal(mean = 1, sd = 5)
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
u
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
Uniform(min = 0, max = 6)
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
